		{"id":"350019bae9ee8a98","type":"text","text":"#### Ankheg Hunting Grounds\n\nDry powder, sandy\nCracking sound, rumbling\n\nAmbushed by two ankhegs\n\nThrew one off with Thunderwave, thodunn cut another down.\nA third surprised Aru,\nAnd a 4th appeared after the boom from thundewave\n\nOne shot by caenis\nOne detonated by Kaulinan\n\nAnkheg eyes can be consumed","x":-480,"y":341,"width":320,"height":439},
